   "code": "EXPOSURE_SPARSITY",
   "text": "Certain play types or sequential patterns might occur too infrequently to provide reliable data for analysis. If the 'exposure' to 'play X' followed by a relevant next possession type is sparse, it will be difficult to draw robust conclusions."
  },
